maluos-firstboot (0.1.10) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Phase 13, shared GPUs, slice G1 (docs/phase13-shared-gpus.md): the GPU
    reader /usr/lib/maluos/maluos_gpu.py (NVIDIA through nvidia-smi, AMD
    and Intel through /sys/class/drm, virtual display adapters skipped),
    the chassis kind and the sharing rule it implies (a server always, a
    dedicated desktop opt-in, a laptop opt-in and idle only), and
    `maluctl gpu status [--json]`. The session's host state and the
    gateway's sharing switch read the same module.

